<title>CANADA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fletcher Challenge.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fletcher Challenge.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Fletcher Challenge Canada Ltd with a market perform recommendation, Donohue Inc as a market perform and Alliance Forest Products Inc as a market outperform.</p>
<p>-- In early Toronto Stock Exchange activity, Fletcher &quot;A&quot; shares were off 0.05 to 22.30, Donohue &quot;A&quot; shares were off 0.15 to 24.25 and Alliance Forest was unchanged at 27.85.  </p>
<p>-- The analyst said his 12-month price targets are: Alliance Forest C$33, Donahue C$26 and Fletcher C$23.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1734))</p>
